WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.288 --> 00:00:07.488
In the emotional moment of sending off your child, it's not easy to hold back tears.

2
00:00:07.824 --> 00:00:16.080
But wiping or rubbing tears with your hand, even with waterproof makeup, can cause smudging and leave dark streaks from the friction.

3
00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:23.256
When tears start welling up, use a clean handkerchief prepared in advance and gently dab, don't rub, around your eyes.

4
00:00:23.592 --> 00:00:32.208
During the moving moment when the couple bows to their parents especially, thinking of something else or looking off into the distance rather than making direct eye contact can help hold back tears.

5
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:39.528
If your makeup smudges, don't worry — gently wipe it with a cotton swab and touch up with a cushion compact, and it'll look flawless again.
